# gunicorn keeps managing the worker processes, and uvicorn serves ASGI in
# them. gunicorn's own ASGI worker (26.1 and 26.2) drops a request that
# arrives on a kept-alive connection while Django is still finishing the
# previous one, which a busy browser or the load balancer does routinely.
